Third-party source integrated into ADAegis
===========================================

This directory holds third-party source code that is built and shipped with
the ADAegis sensor. Each sub-directory keeps the upstream project's own
LICENSE file; the terms in those files govern the corresponding source.

rpcfirewall/
  Upstream : RPC Firewall  (https://github.com/zeronetworks/rpcfirewall)
  Copyright: Zero Networks Ltd.
  License  : RPC Firewall License (see rpcfirewall/LICENSE)
  Notes    : Integrated from source. The LICENSE file was absent from the
             imported archive and was restored from the upstream repository.

ldapfw/
  Upstream : LDAP Firewall  (https://github.com/zeronetworks/ldapfw)
  Copyright: Zero Networks Ltd.
  License  : LDAP Firewall License (see ldapfw/LICENSE)
  Notes    : Integrated from source. The LICENSE file was absent from the
             imported archive and was restored from the upstream repository.
             Bundles jsoncpp (MIT/public-domain, see ldapfw/jsoncpp) and the
             Microsoft Detours dependency is pulled via packages.config.

IMPORTANT - licensing restriction
---------------------------------
Both upstream licenses are custom Zero Networks licenses that grant use,
modification and redistribution BUT explicitly exclude the right to sell or
make commercial use of the work ("the License does not grant You the right to
sale the Work or to make any commercial use of the Work"). Shipping this code
inside a commercial product is not covered by these licenses and requires a
